      "statement": "agent_overrides.resolve_agent_model_id resolves a supported per-thread id over a valid profile override over the team default, while dashboard thread run creation via _resolve_agent_model_choice resolves a valid request pair over profile over team default and leaves the team default for a deprecated request.",
