    {
      "id": "claim_43b45678971048ed916c1a0846b92f9a",
      "statement": "Team settings are stored as a single LangGraph Store record keyed 'default' in the ['team_settings'] namespace, and get_workspace_settings merges the stored record over hardcoded defaults fail-soft so an unreachable store degrades to defaults rather than failing every run.",
