    {
      "id": "claim_77c19aa1532347fa939f4b73c3d77e2c",
      "statement": "get_workspace_settings resolves distinct defaults per role (agent/reviewer/chat), where the chat role inherits the team agent default when no chat-specific model is configured, and separate resolvers exist for the diff-grouping pass (inheriting reviewer subagent) and the thread-title model.",
