    {
      "id": "claim_f460f4a407eb42bfb2dae4b2cd03cd89",
      "statement": "On the run-start path profiles are read fail-soft via load_profile which logs failures and returns None so a store blip costs only per-user overrides, whereas dashboard reads use get_profile so failures surface.",
